  "non_cereal": {
    "_about": "Published non-cereal residue benchmarks for validation/residue_base_dm.R (whep#1399). Every value was read in the source named next to it; none is computed or assumed except where a field says so. No published global non-cereal series in dry matter, by crop, was found that could be opened (Bentsen, Felby & Thorsen 2014, doi:10.1016/j.pecs.2013.09.003, is closed and was not read), so the checks are per crop, each against the best source that could be read.",
    "ipcc_2006_table_11_2": {
      "source": "IPCC (2006) Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Vol. 4, Ch. 11, Table 11.2 (p. 11.17): AGDM (Mg/ha) = Crop/1000 * slope + intercept, Crop = harvested dry matter yield (kg/ha) = fresh yield * DRY. https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/pdf/4_Volume4/V4_11_Ch11_N2O&CO2.pdf",
      "crops": [
